==Battleground==
*1 [[Haterbaa 2.0]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baa Baa]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Baa Baa]]s (600%) spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**15 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although HaterBaa is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy, it has a pathetic 15 HP, less than a [[Metal Doge]] but there's a reason this is an Expert Stage - it deals a whopping 13,500 damage, so bring at least three meatshields. The stage spawns 15 of them after you hit the base, so bring [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cats]] like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]], [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] or [[Rope Jump Cat (Rare Cat)|Rope Jump Cat]].

